# hotelkit

> hotelkit is the central Hotel Operations Platform that digitizes and simplifies all operational processes in hotels. Teams communicate clearly, stay aligned, and manage daily tasks in one place — across communication, housekeeping, facility management, and knowledge management.

hotelkit is available in English, German (https://hotelkit.net/de/), and Spanish (https://hotelkit.net/es/).

## Products

- [Collaboration](https://hotelkit.net/products/collaboration/): Centralize your hotel team's communication on one platform. Share information, keep knowledge accessible, and streamline daily routines with digital checklists.
- [Housekeeping](https://hotelkit.net/products/housekeeping/): Automate your daily cleaning schedule and simplify routine tasks. Digital checklists ensure consistent room cleaning quality and standards.
- [Facility Management](https://hotelkit.net/products/facility-management/): Automate preventive maintenance, report repairs, and streamline asset management — all accessible through the app.
- [Knowledge AI](https://hotelkit.net/products/knowledge-ai/): An AI assistant for hotel teams that works like a chatbot for your digital knowledge base and provides instant answers based on your SOPs.

