- [Repairs & Preventive Maintenance](https://hotelkit.net/solutions/repairs-preventive-maintenance/): Streamline repair and maintenance tasks and improve communication between the maintenance team and other departments.
- [Cleaning Workflows](https://hotelkit.net/solutions/cleaning-workflows/): Manage your housekeeping via app with seamless PMS integration — paper checklists are a thing of the past.
